# PR review bot replies

**`WORKFLOW.md`** step 6.

For every substantive bot thread: reply in-thread before merge — `implemented in <sha>` / `deferred — <reason>` / `declined — <reason>`. Green CI alone does not replace thread closure.

**Gate:** `npm run pr:bot-feedback-check -- --pr <n>` exit **0** before squash merge.

Post-merge audit: `npm run pr:bot-feedback-audit`.
